B.a0A=new A.jm("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/chronocraft/privacy-policy",null)
B.a0B=new A.jm('This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the ChronoCraft mobile application (the "Application" or "Service") and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You.\n\nChronoCraft is a clock, alarm, world clock, timer, and stopwatch utility application developed and published by Sivaprasad NK. By using the Application, You agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.',null)
B.a0C=new A.jm('We may update Our Privacy Policy from time to time by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.',null)
B.a0D=new A.jm("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. Because Your alarms, timers, and preferences are stored locally on Your Device, You can delete all data at any time by deleting items inside the ChronoCraft app or clearing the app storage / uninstalling ChronoCraft from Your Device.",null)
B.a0E=new A.jm("To function reliably as a clock, alarm, and timer utility, ChronoCraft may request standard OS permissions:\n\u2022 Exact Alarms (SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM / USE_EXACT_ALARM): Used strictly to trigger Your scheduled alarms and countdown timers at the exact time You specify.\n\u2022 Notifications & Full-Screen Intent (POST_NOTIFICATIONS / USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT): Used to display active timer progress and alarm alerts when the screen is locked.\n\u2022 Foreground Service & Wake Lock (FOREGROUND_SERVICE / WAKE_LOCK): Used to keep active timers, stopwatches, and ringing alarms running reliably.\n\u2022 Receive Boot Completed (RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED): Used to automatically reschedule enabled alarms after Your Device restarts.\n\u2022 Vibration & Audio Settings (VIBRATE): Used to play alarm tones and vibration patterns.",null)
B.a0F=new A.jm("When You access the Application installed via Google Play, standard platform services (such as Google Play Services) may automatically collect basic, anonymized diagnostic and crash logs (such as device model, OS version, and crash stack traces) solely to help Us fix bugs and improve app stability.",null)
B.a0G=new A.jm("Our Service is a general-audience timekeeping utility and does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.",null)
B.a0H=new A.jm("\u2022 Application: Refers to ChronoCraft, the clock, alarm, timer, and stopwatch software program provided by the Developer.\n\u2022 Developer / We / Us / Our: Refers to Sivaprasad NK, Kerala, India.\n\u2022 Device: Means any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone, tablet, or wearable device.\n\u2022 Personal Data: Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.",null)
B.a0I=new A.jm("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: ChronoCraft does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 Locally Stored App Data: All clock configurations, alarms, alarm labels, timers, stopwatch laps, selected world clock time zones, and theme/display preferences are stored locally on Your Device. This data never leaves Your Device.",null)
